=== Debuff Resistance (Stat) ===
The following effects grant a '''[[Debuff Resist|Debuff Resistance]]''' stat, which reduces the duration of debuffs. Except for {{AbilityIcon|Willpower}}, this is a character stat, not a temporary buff.
* {{HeroIcon|Abrams}}'s {{AbilityIcon|Infernal Resilience}} (Tier 3)
* {{HeroIcon|Warden}}'s {{AbilityIcon|Willpower}} (Tier 3) {{Item stat table|Debuff Resist}}

